WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:25.370 --> 00:00:30.620
Every time I look up to the sky after the rain

3
00:00:30.620 --> 00:00:36.130
I think back to when I was a crybaby

4
00:00:36.130 --> 00:00:43.870
I was chasing somebody's back blindly

5
00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.850
Thinking "I want to be stronger"

6
00:00:46.850 --> 00:00:52.030
The word "thank you" has faded into the wind now

7
00:00:52.200 --> 00:00:57.210
Am I getting stronger?

8
00:00:57.410 --> 00:01:02.880
I don't know the answer yet

9
00:01:03.010 --> 00:01:08.400
That's why I'll keep walking ahead

10
00:01:08.550 --> 00:01:11.030
So let's go

11
00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:14.240
Without stopping

12
00:01:14.240 --> 00:01:19.480
Without giving up to the flow of time

13
00:01:19.480 --> 00:01:25.090
I'll keep getting back up

14
00:01:25.100 --> 00:01:30.730
Because I don't want to lose something precious

15
00:01:30.740 --> 00:01:35.850
The voice inside of me

16
00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:41.250
keeps sustaining me

17
00:01:41.250 --> 00:01:46.380
Wicked rain will get in my way

18
00:01:46.390 --> 00:01:51.320
But I won't walk away

19
00:01:54.420 --> 00:01:56.780
So let's go

20
00:01:56.780 --> 00:02:00.060
Without stopping

21
00:02:00.060 --> 00:02:05.350
Without giving up to the flow of time

22
00:02:05.360 --> 00:02:10.990
I'll keep getting back up

23
00:02:10.990 --> 00:02:16.350
Because I don't want to lose something precious

24
00:02:16.360 --> 00:02:22.050
To the future I believe in...

25
00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:38.150
<b>A Gift to a New Era</b>

26
00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:43.680
The news has quickly spread around the world.

27
00:02:43.680 --> 00:02:47.980
The Whitebeard Pirates have failed to rescue Roger’s son, Ace.

28
00:02:47.980 --> 00:02:52.370
And their legendary captain, Whitebeard, has died.

29
00:02:52.370 --> 00:02:55.420
We’re printing a special edition! Get to work!

30
00:02:55.420 --> 00:02:57.560
This is an important announcement!

31
00:02:57.560 --> 00:03:01.830
Following Fire Fist Ace, we can also confirm the death of Whitebeard!

32
00:03:01.830 --> 00:03:03.540
I repeat:

33
00:03:03.540 --> 00:03:05.430
At Marineford, Whitebeard has...

34
00:03:03.960 --> 00:03:05.430
Whitebeard has...

35
00:03:05.430 --> 00:03:07.030
Died!

36
00:03:07.030 --> 00:03:10.370
The Whitebeard Pirates are done for, as well!

37
00:03:10.370 --> 00:03:12.180
Now the war is over!

38
00:03:12.180 --> 00:03:14.270
We can finally live in peace!

39
00:03:15.290 --> 00:03:21.210
Those who have witnessed this unforgettable historic moment...

40
00:03:21.210 --> 00:03:26.390
have been left speechless.

41
00:03:33.370 --> 00:03:36.090
So you've passed on, Whitebeard.

42
00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:42.580
The man who once rivaled...

43
00:03:42.580 --> 00:03:46.540
the Pirate King on the high seas...

44
00:03:46.540 --> 00:03:49.160
the captain of the Whitebeard Pirates...

45
00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:52.030
and the legendary pirate...

46
00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:54.660
Edward "Whitebeard" Newgate....

47
00:03:54.660 --> 00:03:59.630
has died at the age of 72 in the fierce battle in Marineford Bay...

48
00:03:59.630 --> 00:04:06.550
which broke out between his pirate armada and an alliance of the Navy and the Seven Royal Warlords of the Sea...

49
00:04:13.800 --> 00:04:15.720
That damn bastard...

50
00:04:15.720 --> 00:04:19.640
Marco. We all feel the same way...

51
00:04:19.640 --> 00:04:22.290
but we have to retreat!

52
00:04:22.290 --> 00:04:24.590
I know, Vista.

53
00:04:26.170 --> 00:04:28.430
Don't just stand there! Get on the ship!

54
00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:30.980
Did you forget our captain's final order?!

55
00:04:32.140 --> 00:04:35.260
Jinbe! Hurry and take Ace's brother to safety!

56
00:04:35.260 --> 00:04:36.440
Of course!

57
00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:42.060
He sure was one stubborn bastard...

58
00:04:42.060 --> 00:04:43.630
So he finally bit the dust?

59
00:04:43.630 --> 00:04:46.810
So far, everything has gone exactly according to plan.

60
00:04:46.810 --> 00:04:48.310
Well then, Captain...

61
00:04:49.270 --> 00:04:53.700
Now, it's time to begin!

62
00:05:00.200 --> 00:05:02.350
They're up to something again!

63
00:05:02.350 --> 00:05:03.450
That Teach...

64
00:05:03.450 --> 00:05:05.280
What's he planning to do with Pops?!

65
00:05:08.750 --> 00:05:10.720
I'm about to present...

66
00:05:11.720 --> 00:05:16.490
an amazing show that will astonish the entire world!

67
00:05:16.490 --> 00:05:18.940
What's with that black shroud?!

68
00:05:18.940 --> 00:05:21.770
Blackbeard and Whitebeard are both underneath it!

69
00:05:22.790 --> 00:05:26.400
Now, I must ask that no one enters for the time being.

70
00:05:26.400 --> 00:05:28.870
What are you trying to pull?!

71
00:05:28.870 --> 00:05:32.210
He turned on us after pretending to have joined the Seven Royal Warlords of the Sea!

72
00:05:32.210 --> 00:05:33.350
Don't let your guard down!

73
00:05:35.510 --> 00:05:37.120
I'm looking forward to this.

74
00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:40.520
If this fails, I suppose we'll have to disband.

75
00:05:56.570 --> 00:05:58.870
Captain Buggy, where are you going?!

76
00:05:58.870 --> 00:06:02.520
Are you stupid or what?! I'm running away, of course!

77
00:06:02.520 --> 00:06:05.240
There's no way I can take Whitebeard's head now, is there?

78
00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.380
Captain Buggy...

79
00:06:07.380 --> 00:06:09.000
I failed!

80
00:06:09.000 --> 00:06:11.720
I was too scared, and couldn't even approach him!

81
00:06:11.720 --> 00:06:12.600
I was afraid!

82
00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:17.590
Whitebeard... he was scary in his prime, and he's still scary after dying!

83
00:06:19.060 --> 00:06:21.390
Just go ahead and think I'm pathetic if you want to!

84
00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:25.330
This is where we part ways, you imbeciles!

85
00:06:26.670 --> 00:06:27.870
Captain Buggy!

86
00:06:27.870 --> 00:06:30.590
He's crying... Captain Buggy!

87
00:06:30.590 --> 00:06:33.170
I get it... yesterday's enemies are friends today!

88
00:06:33.170 --> 00:06:38.700
At some point, you felt sympathy for your rival Whitebeard as a fellow man!

89
00:06:38.700 --> 00:06:41.330
Even though you were going to take his head!

90
00:06:41.410 --> 00:06:44.820
And yet you're leaving without trying to make any excuses!

91
00:06:45.600 --> 00:06:47.080
You truly are...

92
00:06:47.080 --> 00:06:52.040
a man among men, just as we always thought you were!

93
00:06:52.040 --> 00:06:54.360
You are too cool, Captain Buggy!

94
00:06:54.360 --> 00:06:56.370
Please wait, Captain Buggy!

95
00:06:56.370 --> 00:06:57.600
Take us with you!

96
00:06:57.600 --> 00:06:59.500
Captain!

97
00:07:03.590 --> 00:07:06.400
Hurry out to sea!

98
00:07:07.490 --> 00:07:09.310
Luffy-kun...

99
00:07:09.310 --> 00:07:12.420
Hang in there... You must survive...

100
00:07:12.420 --> 00:07:15.480
in this world that Ace-san has already left behind...

101
00:07:15.480 --> 00:07:17.980
on to tomorrow... and the day after...

102
00:07:18.950 --> 00:07:19.880
Fire!

103
00:07:21.050 --> 00:07:25.360
You must survive!

104
00:07:25.940 --> 00:07:29.790
Jinbe... If I end up dying like this...

105
00:07:31.840 --> 00:07:36.230
I hate to ask, but please take care of my brother...

106
00:07:39.470 --> 00:07:42.400
I might have to refuse that request, Ace-san...

107
00:07:42.410 --> 00:07:44.450
You mustn't overestimate me.

108
00:07:44.450 --> 00:07:47.520
I'm not that kind-hearted.

109
00:07:47.520 --> 00:07:51.910
He might be your brother, but in the world of pirates...

110
00:07:51.910 --> 00:07:57.350
I will not lend a hand to anyone I don't think highly of, nor will I protect them.

111
00:07:57.350 --> 00:07:59.490
Jinbe! Come onboard!

112
00:07:59.490 --> 00:08:00.390
Sure!

113
00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:02.490
This is...

114
00:08:06.630 --> 00:08:09.150
Damn it... The ocean has been frozen!

115
00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:10.600
We can't set sail!

116
00:08:10.600 --> 00:08:12.640
Quickly, do something about it!

117
00:08:12.640 --> 00:08:14.470
It's Admiral Aokiji!

118
00:08:14.470 --> 00:08:16.770
Hold Aokiji back!

119
00:08:19.310 --> 00:08:21.980
We have no choice... we must take another ship!

120
00:08:31.820 --> 00:08:34.530
I said I wouldn't let him escape.

121
00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:38.230
Just resign yourself to death, you imbecile!

122
00:08:46.710 --> 00:08:50.710
Hand over Dragon’s son!

123
00:08:50.710 --> 00:08:53.800
Akainu... isn't dead?!

124
00:08:53.800 --> 00:08:55.860
I thought Pops finished him off!

125
00:08:55.860 --> 00:08:57.340
He traveled underground...

126
00:08:57.340 --> 00:08:59.240
by melting a path with his magma!

127
00:08:59.240 --> 00:09:01.020
Jinbe!

128
00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:03.690
That isn't happening!

129
00:09:03.690 --> 00:09:09.460
I have already decided to protect this man, even at the cost of my life!

130
00:09:09.460 --> 00:09:13.330
Then, I will not ask again.

131
00:09:19.240 --> 00:09:21.790
Protect Ace's brother!

132
00:09:21.790 --> 00:09:24.280
Ace's family is our family!

133
00:09:24.280 --> 00:09:27.680
Get out of my way, you cowards!

134
00:09:27.680 --> 00:09:29.460
Move aside, Jinbe!

135
00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:33.000
Emporio Face-Growth Hormone

136
00:09:33.950 --> 00:09:38.290
Iva-san. Allow me to help as well.

137
00:09:40.530 --> 00:09:42.770
Great Scissors!

138
00:09:44.260 --> 00:09:47.200
Vi will not let vyou lay one hand on Straw Hat-boy!

139
00:09:47.200 --> 00:09:49.930
I will execute Dragon's son!

140
00:09:49.930 --> 00:09:54.310
Hell... Wink!

141
00:10:00.990 --> 00:10:03.150
Ever since Impel Down...

142
00:10:03.150 --> 00:10:07.780
the damage that Straw Hat-boy has taken, both physically and mentally,

143
00:10:07.780 --> 00:10:10.230
has long since gone past its limits!

144
00:10:11.880 --> 00:10:17.190
If anything else were to happen to Straw Hat-boy now, while Vi'm here...

145
00:10:17.190 --> 00:10:20.970
Vi will never be able to show vmy face to vmy comrade, Dragon, again!

146
00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:22.170
I feel the same way.

147
00:10:24.040 --> 00:10:26.000
Bring it on!

148
00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:32.040
Right now, Vi am burning far, far hotter than vyou are!

149
00:10:46.500 --> 00:10:48.960
Well then, ladies and gentlemen...

150
00:10:48.960 --> 00:10:50.920
Thank you for waiting.

151
00:10:50.920 --> 00:10:54.990
Captain Teach of the Blackbeard Pirates is proud to present...

152
00:10:54.990 --> 00:10:56.970
the world's greatest show.

153
00:10:56.970 --> 00:11:00.300
Please watch closely!

154
00:11:03.840 --> 00:11:06.380
B-Blackbeard!

155
00:11:10.010 --> 00:11:12.350
What was he doing in there?!

156
00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:14.900
Whitebeard hasn't changed at all!

157
00:11:17.330 --> 00:11:19.290
And Blackbeard is unchanged too!

158
00:11:20.760 --> 00:11:23.860
Navy!

159
00:11:24.710 --> 00:11:28.700
Allow me to show you my power!

160
00:11:30.070 --> 00:11:32.970
Now, we are enemies once more.

161
00:11:37.140 --> 00:11:39.000
Black Hole!

162
00:11:41.280 --> 00:11:42.880
What's this?!

163
00:11:48.580 --> 00:11:53.000
This is the power of my Dark-Dark Fruit!

164
00:11:53.000 --> 00:11:54.230
And...

165
00:11:57.430 --> 00:11:59.230
this is...

166
00:12:02.790 --> 00:12:04.070
That stance!

167
00:12:30.640 --> 00:12:31.660
That's...

168
00:12:32.490 --> 00:12:34.630
the power of the Quake-Quake Fruit!

169
00:12:35.330 --> 00:12:40.440
H-How did he use Whitebeard’s power?! He’s dead!

170
00:12:45.450 --> 00:12:47.350
You did it, Captain!

171
00:12:47.350 --> 00:12:50.150
That’s Pops’ earthquake power!

172
00:12:50.150 --> 00:12:53.050
What's going on?! Damn that Teach!

173
00:12:55.670 --> 00:12:59.000
The pull of darkness reverts all to nothing...

174
00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:02.820
while the force of earthquakes destroys everything.

175
00:13:02.820 --> 00:13:08.000
I've obtained it at last! Now, nobody is a match for me!

176
00:13:08.000 --> 00:13:11.500
I am the strongest!

177
00:13:14.410 --> 00:13:16.800
I don't know what he did...

178
00:13:16.800 --> 00:13:19.550
but he's stolen Whitebeard's power!

179
00:13:19.550 --> 00:13:21.310
How can that be possible?!

180
00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:24.960
Then, the terror of the Quake-Quake Fruit...

181
00:13:24.960 --> 00:13:26.710
still hasn't ended?!

182
00:13:26.710 --> 00:13:32.320
I thought it was impossible to have the powers of two Devil Fruits!

183
00:13:32.320 --> 00:13:35.450
It's definitely impossible for ordinary humans...

184
00:13:35.450 --> 00:13:39.560
but... as you all know, Teach isn't quite normal.

185
00:13:39.560 --> 00:13:44.640
His body is fundamentally different from an ordinary person's!

186
00:13:44.640 --> 00:13:47.270
Is that what led to this?!

187
00:13:47.270 --> 00:13:50.070
Hey, did you all see that?!

188
00:13:52.210 --> 00:13:54.760
Let the whole world know this!

189
00:13:54.760 --> 00:13:57.410
Peace-loving, boring commoners!

190
00:13:57.410 --> 00:14:01.020
Marines! World Government! And pirates!

191
00:14:01.440 --> 00:14:03.790
Is this some nightmare?

192
00:14:03.790 --> 00:14:07.160
The future of this world has been decided!

193
00:14:09.460 --> 00:14:12.030
Yes, from now on...

194
00:14:12.030 --> 00:14:13.900
this is my era!

195
00:14:19.730 --> 00:14:22.140
Navy HQ is crumbling to pieces!

196
00:14:27.480 --> 00:14:29.690
Get out of here!

197
00:14:29.690 --> 00:14:32.220
It's hopeless!

198
00:14:35.450 --> 00:14:38.550
Is this... real?

199
00:14:40.550 --> 00:14:44.280
Someone... please tell me this isn't true!

200
00:14:44.280 --> 00:14:48.290
The fortress of justice, the Navy's base,

201
00:14:48.290 --> 00:14:52.830
which has protected the oceans of the world for centuries...

202
00:14:52.830 --> 00:14:55.590
How could it end up like this?!

203
00:15:02.860 --> 00:15:07.360
After capturing Fire Fist Ace to trigger this war...

204
00:15:07.360 --> 00:15:10.210
Blackbeard has stolen Whitebeard’s powers!

205
00:15:10.210 --> 00:15:13.690
Behold, all you people of the world!

206
00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:17.320
Look at me, and my power!

207
00:15:21.730 --> 00:15:24.930
What will happen to the world?!

208
00:15:32.610 --> 00:15:34.660
I can feel the power...

209
00:15:34.660 --> 00:15:38.730
surging through me!

210
00:15:39.360 --> 00:15:40.380
Damn it...

211
00:15:40.380 --> 00:15:43.000
Such incredible power!

212
00:15:43.000 --> 00:15:46.180
It appears that the world’s my oyster!

213
00:15:46.180 --> 00:15:47.660
Damn him!

214
00:15:52.660 --> 00:15:54.880
Hey! What's wrong?

215
00:15:55.490 --> 00:15:59.800
What? Isn't anyone coming?

216
00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:03.280
I'm willing to fight as many of you as you like, too...

217
00:16:03.280 --> 00:16:05.910
What a shame!

218
00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:09.810
Guess there's no helping it.

219
00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:13.440
Then, first of all...

220
00:16:13.460 --> 00:16:17.390
I guess I'll send Marineford to the bottom of the ocean!

221
00:16:18.650 --> 00:16:20.120
What?!

222
00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:41.950
A shockwave?!

223
00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:58.170
We can just rebuild the fortress!

224
00:17:01.850 --> 00:17:03.620
However...

225
00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:08.430
this is the island at the very center of the world: Marineford!

226
00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:11.410
Fleet Admiral...

227
00:17:11.410 --> 00:17:17.270
Our presence here is significant to the citizens of the world...

228
00:17:17.270 --> 00:17:22.450
who fear the villains infesting our waters!

229
00:17:24.000 --> 00:17:27.680
Justice in the name of humanity shall not fall.

230
00:17:27.700 --> 00:17:32.500
You will not so lightly speak of sinking this place.

231
00:17:32.500 --> 00:17:34.290
You callow child!

232
00:17:43.390 --> 00:17:45.920
Such admirable conviction!

233
00:17:45.920 --> 00:17:48.210
Hey, Fleet Admiral-san?

234
00:17:48.210 --> 00:17:50.480
Well then... listen!

235
00:17:51.740 --> 00:17:53.920
Just try to protect it!

236
00:18:07.360 --> 00:18:08.230
Damn it!

237
00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.910
Now's vyour chance! Hurry!

238
00:18:13.700 --> 00:18:15.470
Get Straw Hat-boy to safety!

239
00:18:16.760 --> 00:18:18.380
Forgive me!

240
00:18:21.570 --> 00:18:22.970
Inazuma!

241
00:18:36.630 --> 00:18:38.600
Iva-sama!

242
00:18:43.280 --> 00:18:45.540
Pirate scum!

243
00:18:45.540 --> 00:18:47.570
Akainu!

244
00:18:47.570 --> 00:18:51.510
Jinbe! Give up Dragon’s son!

245
00:18:55.740 --> 00:18:57.880
The sea is my turf!

246
00:18:57.880 --> 00:18:59.250
We can still escape!

247
00:19:07.000 --> 00:19:09.260
Oh, no! It's frozen?!

248
00:19:10.720 --> 00:19:12.430
Aokiji!

249
00:19:14.970 --> 00:19:16.710
So you've come...

250
00:19:20.570 --> 00:19:23.580
Looks like you've lost your escape route!

251
00:19:29.110 --> 00:19:30.810
It didn't work...

252
00:19:30.810 --> 00:19:33.950
Straw Hat Luffy!

253
00:19:34.890 --> 00:19:37.560
You're mine!

254
00:19:48.100 --> 00:19:49.070
Jinbe!

255
00:19:55.350 --> 00:19:58.600
He pierced straight through Jinbe and hit Ace's brother!

256
00:19:58.600 --> 00:20:00.110
Is he still alive?!

257
00:20:05.530 --> 00:20:08.750
You’re in my way, Jinbe!

258
00:20:12.020 --> 00:20:15.480
Luffy-kun... forgive me...

259
00:20:15.480 --> 00:20:18.900
I let you get injured again...

260
00:20:18.900 --> 00:20:22.310
This is no time to worry about others, you scum!

261
00:20:24.590 --> 00:20:28.490
My aim was a little off because you interfered...

262
00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:32.110
It would've been easier for him if I pierced his heart.

263
00:20:32.500 --> 00:20:34.310
Don't you think so, Jinbe?

264
00:20:41.250 --> 00:20:45.080
Are you still trying to protect him, with that hole in your chest?

265
00:20:51.140 --> 00:20:53.050
You'll both die soon enough.

266
00:21:09.160 --> 00:21:10.550
Crocodile!

267
00:21:10.550 --> 00:21:12.550
Sables!

268
00:21:19.290 --> 00:21:22.570
Someone catch him, and get him on a ship already!

269
00:21:22.570 --> 00:21:23.650
Right...

270
00:21:23.650 --> 00:21:25.570
Crocodile!

271
00:21:25.570 --> 00:21:29.190
If you want to protect something, then you should do it right!

272
00:21:29.190 --> 00:21:33.000
Don't let these guys keep doing whatever they want!

273
00:21:34.260 --> 00:21:35.580
Catch him!

274
00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:39.280
It's all over...

275
00:21:39.280 --> 00:21:42.590
I'm so sorry for getting carried away, everyone.

276
00:21:42.590 --> 00:21:45.550
The legend of Captain Buggy is over.

277
00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:48.520
Thank you for supporting me.

278
00:21:48.520 --> 00:21:49.960
Jinbe!

279
00:21:57.350 --> 00:21:59.020
He's not falling back down...

280
00:22:00.290 --> 00:22:01.910
What the hell is this?!

281
00:22:01.910 --> 00:22:03.860
Captain Buggy!

282
00:22:03.860 --> 00:22:07.360
You saved Straw Hat and Jinbe!

283
00:22:07.360 --> 00:22:09.410
I knew it...

284
00:22:10.720 --> 00:22:14.170
Captain Buggy... you just made it look like you were running away,

285
00:22:14.170 --> 00:22:18.850
so that you could save your fellow escapee, Straw Hat, in his time of need!

286
00:22:20.040 --> 00:22:22.100
How noble!

287
00:22:22.100 --> 00:22:24.990
Your nobility is blinding me!

288
00:22:25.590 --> 00:22:28.390
They're acting weird again...

289
00:22:30.220 --> 00:22:32.310
Jinbe and Straw Hat!

290
00:22:33.460 --> 00:22:38.930
How the hell did you end up flying through the air, covered in blood?

291
00:22:38.930 --> 00:22:40.810
Hey, it sure is hot here...

292
00:22:43.000 --> 00:22:45.780
M-Magma!

293
00:22:48.780 --> 00:22:51.360
Thank you, Red Nose...

294
00:22:51.360 --> 00:22:52.580
You saved us.

295
00:22:52.580 --> 00:22:57.810
Still, I let Luffy-kun get another grave injury...

296
00:22:57.810 --> 00:22:59.930
We must treat his wounds immediately!

297
00:22:59.930 --> 00:23:03.810
Oh, shut up! I'm the one who needs help, you dumbass!

298
00:23:03.810 --> 00:23:06.200
It's not like we can treat him up here...

299
00:23:06.810 --> 00:23:08.870
Hey! Who're you calling Red Nose?!

300
00:23:08.870 --> 00:23:12.270
They get in my way even to the very end!

301
00:23:12.270 --> 00:23:14.400
Rose Rondo!

302
00:23:21.180 --> 00:23:24.250
Another pack of vermin...

303
00:23:24.250 --> 00:23:28.150
Do you all wish to die for Straw Hat's sake?

304
00:23:28.710 --> 00:23:35.630
We've all seen his bottomless tenacity and power.

305
00:23:35.630 --> 00:23:40.120
He's the man Ace protected, and Pops respected him!

306
00:23:40.120 --> 00:23:44.160
It is our duty to send him on to the new era!

307
00:23:44.160 --> 00:23:48.790
Every last one of you are fools!

308
00:23:56.520 --> 00:23:58.590
Whitebeard Pirates!

309
00:23:59.420 --> 00:24:00.780
Akainu.

310
00:24:00.780 --> 00:24:05.320
The terrible danger you see in the one you want to kill...

311
00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:10.150
the immense potential we see in the one we want to save...

312
00:24:10.150 --> 00:24:12.640
Ain't they one and the same?!

313
00:24:12.640 --> 00:24:16.540
I can't believe you got me involved again!

314
00:24:16.540 --> 00:24:19.000
Are you listening to me?

315
00:24:19.000 --> 00:24:20.710
Hey, J-Jinbe?

316
00:24:23.160 --> 00:24:25.180
You're unconscious?!

317
00:24:25.180 --> 00:24:28.050
Hey, where should I go now?!

318
00:24:28.050 --> 00:24:29.560
Hey!

319
00:24:30.680 --> 00:24:34.610
Alive or dead, that bastard’s in hell.

320
00:24:35.350 --> 00:24:38.660
Just leave him to suffer!

321
00:24:39.470 --> 00:24:43.630
I guess nothing I say will stop you at this point.

322
00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:46.400
Do your worst!

323
00:25:00.160 --> 00:25:01.810
I-It's hopeless...

324
00:25:01.810 --> 00:25:05.280
Sengoku and Blackbeard are over there...

325
00:25:12.370 --> 00:25:15.120
And Akainu and the commanders are over there...

326
00:25:22.170 --> 00:25:25.140
The battle will never end!

327
00:25:25.140 --> 00:25:28.270
Captain Buggy! Do something!

328
00:25:28.270 --> 00:25:30.010
Like hell, you idiots!

329
00:25:39.250 --> 00:25:40.930
What the...

330
00:25:40.930 --> 00:25:43.090
It's a ship!

331
00:25:43.090 --> 00:25:45.460
That's a submarine!

332
00:25:45.460 --> 00:25:47.460
Whose ship is that?

333
00:25:49.190 --> 00:25:51.400
Bring Straw Hatter over here!

334
00:25:52.000 --> 00:25:57.630
"Straw Hatter"? That sure is a weird way to address a guy...

335
00:25:57.640 --> 00:25:59.670
Who are you, kid?!

336
00:26:00.350 --> 00:26:02.820
Straw Hatter and I will probably be enemies someday...

337
00:26:02.820 --> 00:26:04.140
but I have nothing against him.

338
00:26:04.800 --> 00:26:07.600
It'd be no fun to let him die here.

339
00:26:07.700 --> 00:26:12.420
<b>Captain of the Heart Pirates Trafalgar Law</b>

340
00:26:08.190 --> 00:26:12.420
I'll get him out of here. Hand him over!

341
00:26:12.420 --> 00:26:13.940
What?!

342
00:26:20.200 --> 00:26:23.040
I'm a doctor!

343
